    {
      "id": "db-sub", "type": "text", "x": 42, "y": 294, "width": 206, "height": 176,
      "text": "profiles\n  id, full_name, phone\nchildren\n  name, age, condition_description,\n  condition_normalized\ngroups\n  condition_name\ngroup_members\n  user_id, group_id, child_id\nmessages  (group chat + system pills)\ndirect_messages  (1-on-1 DMs)\nresources  (library per group)\ndocuments  (file uploads)",
      "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#0891b2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "angle": 0, "opacity": 100
    },
    {
      "id": "arrow-db-supabase", "type": "arrow", "x": 262, "y": 360, "width": 36, "height": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#0891b2", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "endArrowhead": "arrow", "startArrowhead": null,
      "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0
    },

    {
      "id": "flow-box", "type": "rectangle", "x": 30, "y": 510, "width": 750, "height": 140,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#f0fdf4", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 }, "angle": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "flow-label", "type": "text", "x": 50, "y": 522, "width": 200, "height": 20,
      "text": "End-to-End User Flow", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#15803d", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "angle": 0, "opacity": 100
    },
    {
      "id": "flow-steps", "type": "text", "x": 50, "y": 544, "width": 710, "height": 96,
      "text": "1. Visit not-alone-jade.vercel.app  →  2. Register (name, email, phone, password)  →  3. Email confirmation via Supabase Auth\n4. Onboarding: add child (name, age) + describe condition (type or mic voice input)  →  5. conditionMatcher.ts scores 60+ keyword rules\n6. Normalised to scientific name e.g. \"Childhood Apraxia of Speech (CAS)\"  →  7. API finds/creates group, upserts group_members, inserts [[joined]] pill\n8. Dashboard: children cards, group cards (live member count + last message), DM threads\n9. Group chat (Supabase Realtime) + Resources tab  →  10. DM any parent privately (1-on-1)  →  11. Leave group / edit child to re-join",
      "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#166534", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "angle": 0, "opacity": 100
    },

    {
      "id": "realtime-box", "type": "rectangle", "x": 30, "y": 670, "width": 360, "height": 110,
      "strokeColor": "#d97706", "backgroundColor": "#fffbeb", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 }, "angle": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "realtime-label", "type": "text", "x": 50, "y": 682, "width": 320, "height": 20,
      "text": "Realtime (Supabase WebSocket)", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#92400e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "angle": 0, "opacity": 100
    },
    {
      "id": "realtime-sub", "type": "text", "x": 50, "y": 704, "width": 320, "height": 66,
      "text": "channel: group-{id}  subscribe to messages INSERT\nchannel: dm-{userA}-{userB}  subscribe to direct_messages\n[[joined]] / [[left]] stored in messages table → rendered as pills\nprofilesMapRef (useRef) caches userId→name client-side\nNo polling — push-based via Postgres logical replication",
      "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#d97706", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "angle": 0, "opacity": 100
    },

    {
      "id": "security-box", "type": "rectangle", "x": 420, "y": 670, "width": 360, "height": 110,
      "strokeColor": "#dc2626", "backgroundColor": "#fef2f2", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 }, "angle": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "security-label", "type": "text", "x": 440, "y": 682, "width": 320, "height": 20,
      "text": "Security & RLS Policies", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#991b1b", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "angle": 0, "opacity": 100
    },
    {
      "id": "security-sub", "type": "text", "x": 440, "y": 704, "width": 320, "height": 66,
      "text": "All tables gated by Supabase RLS + JWT\nprofiles: SELECT open to all authenticated users\ngroup_members: own rows only (join / leave)\nmessages: group members only (read + write)\ndirect_messages: sender OR recipient only\nchildren / documents: own parent_id only",
      "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#dc2626", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "angle": 0, "opacity": 100
    },

    {
      "id": "stack-box", "type": "rectangle", "x": 30, "y": 800, "width": 750, "height": 56,
      "strokeColor": "#6b7280", "backgroundColor": "#f9fafb", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 }, "angle": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "stack-label", "type": "text", "x": 50, "y": 812, "width": 710, "height": 34,
      "text": "Stack: Next.js 14 (App Router) · TypeScript · Tailwind CSS · Supabase (Postgres + Auth + Realtime + Storage) · Vercel · GitHub\nCondition engine: custom keyword matcher (conditionMatcher.ts, ~150 lines, 0 API cost, 70+ conditions)  ·  No LLM used in production  ·  MIT licence, free forever",
      "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "angle": 0, "opacity": 100
    }
